data: {"level":2,"reviewed":{"level":2,"label":"formula / approach","text":"Keep a list of nodes that you have started but not finished. Walking down the left side pushes\neach node, and the last one pushed is the leftmost. When you cannot go further left, the top of the\nlist is a node whose left subtree is done: emit it, then move to its right child and repeat. The\nwalk ends when the list is empty and the current pointer is `None`."},"hints_note":null}

